        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWBELCOM, Bellagio Lever With Newport Rose Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Newport Rose and matching Newport Deadbolt, combined with the Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. The elegant styling of the Single Cylinder Bellagio Leverset With Newport Rose makes it universally appealing for a wide variety of office or home styles. Unencumbered by complexity, this traditional design is much sought after in decorative door hardware. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware. The rope detailing gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Newport Single Cylinder Entry Set Combo With Bellagio Lever fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWBELCOM Single Cylinder Bellagio Leverset With Newport Rose:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bellagio Lever With Newport Rose Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BEL-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Bellagio Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NEW-rose.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NEW-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Bellagio Leverset With Newport Rose, Grandeur NEWBELCOM",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWBELCOM, Bellagio Lever With Newport Rose Combo - The Newport Rose and matching Newport Deadbolt, combined with the Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. The elegant styling of the Single Cylinder Bellagio Leverset With Newport Rose makes it universally appealing for a wide variety of office or home styles. Unencumbered by complexity, this traditional design is much sought after in decorative door hardware. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware. The rope detailing gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Newport Single Cylinder Entry Set Combo With Bellagio Lever fits doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
                "keywords": "Newport Rose With Bellagio Lever Single Cylinder Combos, Newport Rose With Bellagio Lever Combos, GRA-NEWBELCOM, Grandeur NEWBELCOM, rope levers, wave levers, traditional levers, classic levers, Single Cylinder Newport Rose With Bellagio Lever Combos, Single Cylinder Bellagio Lever With Newport Roses, Newport Combos, Grandeur Newport series,"
